sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kafka
    participant R as router
    participant Q as email.send
    participant W as worker
    participant D as Redis
    participant M as SMTP
    K->>R: OrderConfirmed evt-1 (again, after a relay retry)
    R->>Q: job evt-1 (confirmed)
    R->>K: commit offset
    Q->>W: job evt-1
    W->>D: EXISTS notif:sent:evt-1
    D-->>W: 1
    W->>Q: ack (duplicate, nothing sent)
